  "description": "WP1 built and maintains csv-to-json-ld, the tooling behind the MARCO-BOLO metadata catalog. Metadata is authored as per-class CSVs, described with CSV on the Web metadata documents, validated against CSV-W constraints, manual foreign key constraints and SHACL shapes, then converted to RDF and framed as JSON-LD for publication and harvesting.",
  "name": "WP1: Development of the csv-to-json-ld metadata pipeline",
